<form id="skill-form" class="skill-form" autocomplete="off" novalidate>
    <div id="skill-title" class="skill-title"></div>
    <div class="skill-row skill-row-top">
        <label class="skill-field-group skill-group-name">
            <span class="skill-label">name</span>
            <input id="skill-name" class="skill-field skill-name" type="text" placeholder="name" spellcheck="false" />
        </label>
        <div class="skill-field-group">
            <span class="skill-label">skill dependencies</span>
            <div id="skill-dependencies" class="multiselect">
                <button type="button" class="multiselect-toggle" aria-haspopup="listbox" aria-expanded="false">
                    <span class="multiselect-label">MultiSelect &lt;Dependencies&gt;</span>
                </button>
                <div class="multiselect-menu">
                    <input class="multiselect-search" type="search" placeholder="filter skills" title="prefix with ! to exclude" spellcheck="false" aria-label="filter skills" />
                    <div class="multiselect-options" role="listbox" aria-multiselectable="true"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <button type="button" id="skill-new" class="skill-square" title="new skill depending on this one" aria-label="new skill depending on this one">+</button>
        <div class="skill-field-group">
            <span class="skill-label">skill references</span>
            <div id="skill-references" class="multiselect">
                <button type="button" class="multiselect-toggle" aria-haspopup="listbox" aria-expanded="false">
                    <span class="multiselect-label">MultiSelect &lt;References&gt;</span>
                </button>
                <div class="multiselect-menu">
                    <input class="multiselect-search" type="search" placeholder="filter references" title="prefix with ! to exclude" spellcheck="false" aria-label="filter references" />
                    <div class="multiselect-options" role="listbox" aria-multiselectable="true"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <button type="button" id="reference-new" class="skill-square" title="new reference" aria-label="new reference">+</button>
        <div class="skill-field-group">
            <span class="skill-label">projects</span>
            <div id="skill-projects" class="multiselect">
                <button type="button" class="multiselect-toggle" aria-haspopup="listbox" aria-expanded="false">
                    <span class="multiselect-label">MultiSelect &lt;Projects&gt;</span>
                </button>
                <div class="multiselect-menu">
                    <input class="multiselect-search" type="search" placeholder="filter projects" title="prefix with ! to exclude" spellcheck="false" aria-label="filter projects" />
                    <div class="multiselect-options" role="listbox" aria-multiselectable="true"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="skill-row">
        <label class="skill-field-group">
            <span class="skill-label">description</span>
            <input id="skill-description" class="skill-field" type="text" placeholder="description" spellcheck="false" />
        </label>
        <label class="skill-field-group">
            <span class="skill-label">url</span>
            <input id="skill-url" class="skill-field" type="text" placeholder="url" spellcheck="false" />
        </label>
    </div>
    <div class="skill-row">
        <label class="skill-field-group">
            <span class="skill-label">keywords</span>
            <input id="skill-keywords" class="skill-field" type="text" placeholder="keywords (space separated, searchable)" spellcheck="false" />
        </label>
    </div>
    <label class="skill-field-group skill-group-content">
        <span class="skill-label">content</span>
        <textarea id="skill-content" class="skill-content" spellcheck="false" placeholder="# &lt;skill-name&gt;

&lt;One sentence: what this skill lets an agent do.&gt;

## when to load

- &lt;trigger phrase a user would actually type&gt;
- &lt;trigger phrase&gt;
- &lt;trigger phrase&gt;

## dependencies

- `&lt;project&gt;/&lt;skill-name&gt;` — owns &lt;ground&gt;. This skill assumes it and does not re-teach it.
  `get-skill(project: &quot;&lt;project&gt;&quot;, name: &quot;&lt;skill-name&gt;&quot;)`
- none — this skill stands alone.

## procedure

1. **&lt;verb-first step&gt;** — &lt;what to do, and why it matters&gt;.
2. **&lt;verb-first step&gt;** — &lt;what to do&gt;.
3. **&lt;verb-first step&gt;** — &lt;what to do&gt;.

## checklist — done when

- [ ] &lt;observable result the reader can verify&gt;
- [ ] &lt;observable result&gt;
- [ ] &lt;observable result&gt;
"></textarea>
    </label>
    <div class="skill-row skill-actions">
        <span class="skill-status" role="status"></span>
        <button type="button" id="skill-revert" class="skill-button">Revert</button>
        <button type="submit" id="skill-save" class="skill-button skill-save">Save</button>
    </div>
</form>
<div id="reference-modal" class="modal" hidden>
    <div class="modal-backdrop" data-modal-close></div>
    <form id="reference-form" class="modal-panel" autocomplete="off" novalidate>
        <div class="modal-title">New reference</div>
        <label class="modal-field">
            <span class="modal-label">name</span>
            <input id="reference-name" class="skill-field" type="text" placeholder="name" spellcheck="false" required />
        </label>
        <label class="modal-field">
            <span class="modal-label">description</span>
            <input id="reference-description" class="skill-field" type="text" placeholder="description" spellcheck="false" required />
        </label>
        <label class="modal-field">
            <span class="modal-label">type</span>
            <select id="reference-type" class="skill-field">
                <option value="literature" selected>literature</option>
                <option value="image">image</option>
                <option value="video">video</option>
                <option value="commands">commands</option>
                <option value="script">script</option>
                <option value="configuration">configuration</option>
            </select>
        </label>
        <label class="modal-field modal-field-grow">
            <span class="modal-label">content</span>
            <textarea id="reference-content" class="skill-content" spellcheck="false" placeholder="content" required></textarea>
        </label>
        <div class="modal-actions">
            <span id="reference-status" class="skill-status" role="status"></span>
            <button type="button" id="reference-cancel" class="skill-button">Cancel</button>
            <button type="submit" id="reference-save" class="skill-button skill-save">Create</button>
        </div>
    </form>
</div>
